## Scope and third-party components

This MIT license covers the code, deployment scripts, and documentation created
for this project, including the Windows one-click deployment entry points, the
admin gateway, the admin UI integration, and the documentation in `docs/`.

It does **not** relicense third-party components:

1. Original QQ Agent code - MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 白光 (liuyuyu599com-svg).
   Full text: `qq-agent/LICENSE`. This project is an independently maintained
derivative and is not an official release of the original author.
2. React Bits components - GradientText, Dock, ThoughtLine, ProfileCard,
   TargetCursor, JellyRadio, SoftAurora, LightPillar, SquishSwitch.
   MIT + Commons Clause License Condition v1.0, Copyright (c) 2026 David Haz.
   They are integrated into this application, not offered as a standalone
component library. Full text: `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`.
3. NapCat, Node.js, and Microsoft Visual C++ runtime - downloaded from their
   upstream projects at deployment time and remain under their own licenses and
terms of service. They are not redistributed as binaries by this source
repository.

See `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` for the complete set of included notices.

